  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Indonesia Maritime Capacity Building Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Maritime Capacity Building Initiative comprises activities designed to strengthen Indonesia&#x2019;s maritime domain awareness, improve information sharing to combat international maritime crimes; boost cooperation to combat illegal, unreported and unregulated (IUU) fishing; improve maritime, port and ship safety; and improve Indonesia&#x2019;s capabilities to protect and manage its maritime resources, including living resources and its marine environment. Activities implemented under the Initiative are closely aligned with priorities identified in the Maritime Plan of Action and other strategic documents guiding Indonesia&#x2019;s development plans.</narrative>
  </description>
